   Message Reading Menu (Sysop)

   [#] Springe zu einer spez. Nachricht    [NS] Non-Stop Nachrichten lesen
   [+] Lesen d. Nachrichten vorwaerts      [Q] Quit/Skip lesen d. Nachrichten
   [-] Lesen d. Nachrichten rueckwaerts    [R] Antwort auf Nachricht
   [A] Nachricht nochmnals zeigen          [RETURN] Naechste Nachricht lesen
   [D] Loesche diese Nachricht             [TM] Touch Message                
   [E] Editiere diese Nachricht            [X] Xfer, Download dieser Nachricht

   [C] Copy Msg to another area            [M] Move Msg to another area
   [EH] Edit Msg Header                    [P] Put/Save Msg to a path&filename
   [F] Forward Msg to another user         [TA] Trace the author
   [L] Lock a Message from Deletion        [!] Edit users account

